During the 1937–38 Scottish football season, [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] competed in the [[Scottish First Division]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.londonhearts.com/scores/a1930/celtic1938.htm|title=Results for Celtic for 1937-38|website=www.londonhearts.com}}</ref>

